# TISMA OS: sin traducciones que el sistema no usa ni documentación de paquetes (la ISO pesaba ~800 MB más).
# Las licencias (copyright) se conservan siempre. Para otro idioma: quitar sus líneas y reinstalar los paquetes.
path-exclude=/usr/share/doc/*
path-include=/usr/share/doc/*/copyright
path-exclude=/usr/share/locale/*
path-include=/usr/share/locale/es/*
path-include=/usr/share/locale/es_*/*
path-include=/usr/share/locale/en/*
path-include=/usr/share/locale/en_*/*
path-include=/usr/share/locale/locale.alias
path-exclude=/usr/share/man/*
path-include=/usr/share/man/man*
path-include=/usr/share/man/es/*
path-exclude=/usr/share/help/*
path-include=/usr/share/help/C/*
path-include=/usr/share/help/es/*
path-exclude=/usr/lib/chromium/locales/*
path-include=/usr/lib/chromium/locales/es.pak
path-include=/usr/lib/chromium/locales/es-419.pak
path-include=/usr/lib/chromium/locales/en-US.pak
